#: ../../source/libraries/robot/robot_world.md:3
msgid ""
"`RobotWorld` is a `TiledWorld` subclass that hosts the robot simulation. "
"It reads its dimensions, background color, pre-placed objects, and "
"allowed robot abilities from a `WorldConfig` dataclass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/robot/robot_world.md:7
msgid ""
"Use `load_world(...)` or `task(...)` to create a pre-configured instance "
"rather than constructing `RobotWorld` directly."
msgstr ""

